{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>$69件!神級香滑拖肥醬+鬆化批底</p><p>Lady M 全新香蕉拖肥批！</p><p>最近香蕉拖肥批熱潮不斷，今個9月連Lady M都推出香蕉拖肥批(Banoffee Pie)！巧妙融合香蕉果香、拖肥焦糖與絲滑忌廉，由外到內層次都充滿驚喜。切餅一件$69，原個6 吋批$480， 現已接受網上預訂，甜品迷一定要試！</p><p>香蕉味濃郁幼滑＋批底口感鬆化</p><p>批面頂層綴以花瓣般的香蕉忌廉，撒上70% 微苦黑朱古力碎，仲有高貴典雅的焦糖鏡面；中間夾層是朱古力海綿蛋糕，配以自家製拖肥焦糖醬，質地香甜絲滑；底層批底口感鬆化重牛油香，所有層次配搭都好完美！</p><p>Lady M 供應門市：Lady M 香港及澳門全線分店（件裝每日限量供應） 原個預訂詳情：2026 年 9 月 17 日起接受網上預訂（最早提取日期為 9 月 23 日）</p><p>官方IG：@ladymhk</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178997042101013189_5668420496ab0c7f577cde.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178997042328874462_3541713446ab0c7f7d226b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178997042581581915_8290984856ab0c7fa1f577.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178997042764214269_2601074896ab0c7fbe411d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178997042953617464_20816672016ab0c7fdd9b3b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178997043104134201_3196024176ab0c7ff51aa4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178997043256112676_8058946076ab0c800d6bfe.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-21T06:19:05.239861+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":434,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}